<title>HONG KONG: HK Land Auction - Lantau site fetches HK$40 mln.</title>
<headline>HK Land Auction - Lantau site fetches HK$40 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 24,111 square foot site on Hong Kong's Lantau Island sold for HK$40 million at a government land auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The land auction is the last in Hong Kong before the territory returns to Chinese rule at midnight on June 30.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441  http://www.hk97.com</p>
